<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Let The Right One In</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Boston Manor</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Desperate Times, Desperate Pleasures</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1NeC3eus5OI5YAQeBiTZMw</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作词: "},{"tx":"Henry Cox"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Ash Wilson"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Michael Cunniff"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Daniel Cunniff"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Jordan Pugh"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作曲: "},{"tx":"Henry Cox"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Ash Wilson"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Michael Cunniff"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Daniel Cunniff"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Jordan Pugh"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">A flower that is yet to be picked gets to grow in the ground &amp; blossom each year.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You were a monsoon left out in the cold by wicked transgressors.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I’d bury them all.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I’d kill for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Don’t let them in)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I’d die for you.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your love is like diamonds, your past is like coal.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Keep your words in my pocket darling, I’d savour them all.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If I ever got caught, oh the things I would do.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I’d make them suffer for what they did to you.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I’d kill for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I’d die for you.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">A flower that is yet to be picked gets to grow in the ground &amp; blossom each year.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I’d kill for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I’d die for you.</p></div></body></tt>